  "proof": "The two knots have top HFK rank one (fibered), the same nonunit irreducible Alexander polynomial, and unequal Jones polynomials. Thus their difference is nonribbon by Abe--Tagami Corollary 4.3 (Miyazaki Theorem 5.5). Fiberedness plus irreducibility also implies primality by genus additivity. Nothing here proves the difference slice. A ribbon disk for D # J with the independently certified ribbon partner J would prove D slice.",
